<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Auction Ended</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Poppins', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F8FAFC; margin: 0; padding: 0; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; background-color: #F8FAFC; padding-bottom: 40px; }
        .main { background-color: #ffffff; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; border-spacing: 0; font-family: sans-serif; color: #111111; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #bdbdbd; }
        .header { background-color: #ffffff; padding: 40px 0; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 40px 50px; text-align: center; }
        .icon-circle { width: 70px; height: 70px; background-color: #64748B; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 30px; display: block; }
        h1 { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0 0 20px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #64748B; margin: 0 0 25px; }
        .info-card { background-color: #F8FAFC; border: 1px solid #E2E8F0; border-radius: 20px; padding: 30px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: center; }
        .info-label { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; color: #64748B; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 10px; display: block; }
        .info-value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 900; color: #111111; margin: 0; }
        .button { display: inline-block; padding: 18px 45px; background-color: #C90000; color: #ffffff !important; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 14px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; transition: all 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(201,0,0,0.1); }
        .footer { padding: 40px 50px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #94A3B8; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <center class="wrapper">
        <table class="main" width="100%">
            <tr>
                <td class="header">
                    <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Mototrad" width="140" style="display: block; margin: 0 auto;">
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="content">
                    <div class="icon-circle">
                        <img src="https://img.icons8.com/ios-filled/35/ffffff/alarm-clock.png" style="vertical-align: middle; padding-top: 17px;">
                    </div>
                    <h1>Auction Ended</h1>
                    <p>The auction for <strong>{{auctionTitle}}</strong> has ended. Unfortunately, the item did not meet the reserve price or no bids were placed.</p>
                    
                    <div class="info-card">
                        <span class="info-label">Highest Bid Reached</span>
                        <p class="info-value">${{highestBid}}</p>
                    </div>

                    <a href="{{frontendUrl}}/auctions" class="button">Browse More Auctions</a>

                    <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: 30px;">Don't worry! There are plenty of other premium assets waiting for your bid.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="footer">
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 10px;">&copy; {{year}} Mototrad. All rights reserved.</p>
                    <p>You received this because you participated in an auction on Mototrad.</p>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
    </center>
</body>
</html>
